{"seq":2,"slug":"economic-moats","title":"经济护城河","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/warren-buffett/ideas-and-methods/economic-moats","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-moat-concept","title":"护城河概念","url":"/c/people/warren-buffett/ideas-and-methods/economic-moats/the-moat-concept","wordCount":1508,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"quality-over-cheapness","title":"质量重于廉价","url":"/c/people/warren-buffett/ideas-and-methods/economic-moats/quality-over-cheapness","wordCount":1449,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 经济护城河\n\n寻找拥有持久竞争优势的企业，是巴菲特投资选择的核心。本章阐释其护城河思想。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"护城河概念\"——他如何用这一比喻揭示企业持久竞争优势的本质。第二篇文档讲述\"质量重于廉价\",呈现他从\"捡便宜\"到\"买伟大企业\"的成熟投资观。\n"}